     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">近日有R友提及使用barplot時, 如何完成相鄰群組繪圖, 參考 ?barplot 範例中, 將資料以 matrix 呈現, 可快速繪製 barplot 相鄰群組繪圖.<div><br></div><div>說明: <br><div><br></div><div>1. 使用 matrix 建立矩陣</div><div>2. 加入 beside=TRUE</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-QrSKREu0ZWM/Wml_T8XCdwI/AAAAAAAAQPs/B6VsljqsBCMOkzuDXghJeC6moJlMrkKGACLcBGAs/s1600/barplot.sideplot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-QrSKREu0ZWM/Wml_T8XCdwI/AAAAAAAAQPs/B6VsljqsBCMOkzuDXghJeC6moJlMrkKGACLcBGAs/s1600/barplot.sideplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237494290000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lvl7d15SNC05jtf2qJ1Et\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-QrSKREu0ZWM/Wml_T8XCdwI/AAAAAAAAQPs/B6VsljqsBCMOkzuDXghJeC6moJlMrkKGACLcBGAs/s400/barplot.sideplot.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"215\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#666600\"># title: barplot with different color</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"># date: 2018.1.25</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">test &lt;- head(iris[-5])</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">test1 &lt;- tail(iris[-5])</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">test2 &lt;- iris[seq(1,11,by=2),-5]</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">mytest &lt;- matrix(unlist(c(test[4,], test1[4,], test2[4,])), </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">                 ncol=4, </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">                 byrow=TRUE, </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">                 dimnames=list(c(&quot;test&quot;, &quot;test1&quot;, &quot;test2&quot;), names(test)))</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">mytest</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">barplot(mytest, beside=TRUE, main=&quot;My Barchart&quot;, ylab = &quot;Numbers&quot;, </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">        cex.lab = 1.5, </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">        cex.main = 1.4, </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">        col=c(&quot;lightblue&quot;, &quot;mistyrose&quot;, &quot;lightcyan&quot;),</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">        legend = rownames(mytest), ylim = c(0, 10))</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"># end</font></div></div></code></div><br></div></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
